what the two faces' Fresnel and the tint let through at all ((1-F)^2 tint^2, luma), not the field
alone: at grazing the field fell with the Fresnel though nothing blocked it, and the rim of a clear
ball filled with the degree-3 field (athenea: rim relMSE 0.083 -> 0.062). Its mesh2splat half (a
solid's near face covering 1 on a dome-only stage) is in the data. Only a solid glass changes.

